{"schema_version":"d_pc_direction_full_review_cover_patch_round2_v1","steam_appid":"4359350","display_title":"NeverCOM","sources":{"player":{"label":"普通玩家","readable_count":20,"empty_status_count":0,"reviews":[{"id":"p001","recommendation":"推荐","text":"开发组一看就是人不多，但能感觉到他们在玩法上是真的花了心思的。不是那种随便抄个玩法换皮的罐头游戏","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854178817/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p002","recommendation":"推荐","text":"这个独游确实是“在任何时间线都未曾见过的游戏”，没有同类，有点意思","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854088564/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p003","recommendation":"推荐","text":"画面没啥特点，不过MOBA游戏的一切机制都有了，不过这居然是一个独游？你敢信？","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199853952460/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p004","recommendation":"推荐","text":"B站搜NeverCOM，全是主播老六名场面集锦。看完之后你只会想一个问题：为什么别人的伪装是天衣无缝，我的伪装是此地无银？","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854588240/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p005","recommendation":"推荐","text":"这个地雷机制尼玛真是反人性，策划绝对有病，建议去医院看下，哈哈哈哈","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854320016/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p006","recommendation":"推荐","text":"其实这是个收菜游戏，每个把小时就得回来看看自己的时间菜是不是被人偷光了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854676180/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p007","recommendation":"推荐","text":"7块钱，Steam上一张集换式卡牌的钱。我买了之后玩了20个小时，平均每小时3毛5。这性价比，我哭死。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854098977/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p008","recommendation":"推荐","text":"夏促逛了半天，3A大作买不起，独立游戏怕踩雷。看到这个7块钱，想着‘亏也就亏一顿早饭钱’，结果——香疯了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854686479/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p009","recommendation":"推荐","text":"30块打折到了7块？一个多人对战游戏？制作组估计不想回本了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854217206/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p010","recommendation":"推荐","text":"建议改名叫《时间线版Among Us》。你永远不知道身边那个勤勤恳恳加稳定值的‘队友’，是不是对面派来的老六。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199853693890/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p011","recommendation":"推荐","text":"看B站主播玩：各种花式伪装、精准爆破，弹幕刷‘666’。我自己玩：伪装三秒就被识破，然后被追着打了一条街。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854642704/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p012","recommendation":"推荐","text":"本以为是个LOL，玩进去才发现是个资源管理+买期权游戏。7块钱买到这脑洞，血赚。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199853345413/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p013","recommendation":"推荐","text":"重复进入已知时间线的设计有点意思了。那种‘我回来了，这次带了三倍火力’的感觉，复仇感拉满。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199853393387/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p014","recommendation":"推荐","text":"探索新时间线就像开盲盒——你永远不知道下一条是资源丰富的富矿，还是开局就快崩了的烂摊子。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854293138/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p015","recommendation":"推荐","text":"独立游戏最大的魅力就是：你不知道它什么时候会给你一个惊喜。NeverCOM就是那种‘看起来其貌不扬，玩起来欲罢不能’的类型。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199853574253/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p016","recommendation":"推荐","text":"虽然平衡性偶尔会整活，但是可以看出制作组还是想过了的","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199853959711/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p017","recommendation":"推荐","text":"建议新手第一局先别管什么阵营，先学会别被自己的地雷炸死。别问我怎么知道的。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199853676517/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p018","recommendation":"推荐","text":"这游戏最牛的地方是：它真的没有同类。你说它是MOBA吧，它有时间线管理。你说它是策略吧，它有实时对战。你说它是派对游戏吧，它又能让你认真算数。就挺神奇的。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854596448/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p019","recommendation":"推荐","text":"废土地图那个“毒水河+陷阱湖+草丛”的地形组合，完美诠释了什么叫“处处是坑”。走河道掉血，走湖边踩雷，走草丛被阴——那走哪？答案是走队友的尸体上。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854103914/recommended/4359350/"},{"id":"p020","recommendation":"推荐","text":"手机版优化得还行，虽然画面糊了点但能玩","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199854498312/recommended/4359350/"}],"groups":[{"key":"helpful","label":"最有价值的","review_ids":["p001","p002","p003","p004","p005","p006","p007","p008","p009","p010","p011","p012","p013","p014","p015","p016","p017","p018","p019","p020"]},{"key":"recent","label":"最新","review_ids":["p001","p002","p003","p004","p005","p006","p007","p008","p009","p010","p011","p012","p013","p014","p015","p016","p017","p018","p019","p020"]},{"key":"summary","label":"概要","review_ids":["p003","p004","p006","p009","p010","p012","p013","p015","p018","p019"]},{"key":"funny","label":"欢乐","review_ids":["p006"]}]},"curator":{"label":"鉴赏家","readable_count":4,"empty_status_count":0,"reviews":[{"id":"c001","recommendation":"推荐","text":"Asymmetric PvP game about controlling timelines. Choose Order or Chaos, explore time threads, and fight for their fate. Unique concept.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/46103764-Curator-404FS/"},{"id":"c002","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"Gen AI for visuals and promo assets.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45944619-Games-That-Use-AI-Generation/"},{"id":"c003","recommendation":"推荐","text":"NeverCOM feels like someone mixed a twin-stick shooter with timeline chess. Messy in places, but the faction war and frantic PvP runs are weirdly addictive.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/42708084-Potato-Coalition/"},{"id":"c004","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"Uses genAi in game creation","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45857233-Game-uses-Ai/"}],"groups":[{"key":"recommended","label":"推荐","review_ids":["c001","c003"]},{"key":"not_recommended","label":"不推荐","review_ids":["c002","c004"]}]}}}
